%20informal%20Conversations%20%28and%20coffee%29%20with%20a%20Commissioner%20on%20Saturday%2C%20Nov.%2011%2C%202-3%3A30%20p.m.%20at%20%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%22https%3A%2F%2Fsondercoffee.co%2F%22%3E%3Cspan%20data-contrast%3D%22none%22%3ESonder%20Coffee%20and%20Tea%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cspan%20data-contrast%3D%22auto%22%3E%20on%20Iliff%20Ave.%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Cspan%20data-ccp-props%3D%22%7B%7D%22%3E%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cspan%20data-contrast%3D%22auto%22%3EAt%20this%20special%20drop-in%20session%2C%20grab%20a%20cup%20of%20coffee%20and%20chat%20with%20the%20commissioner%20about%20the%20topics%20important%20to%20you%3A%20health%20and%20safety%2C%20transportation%2C%20housing%2C%20property%20taxes%26mdash%3Byou%20name%20it.%20The%20event%20provides%20community%20members%20with%20an%20opportunity%20to%20interact%20with%20your%20elected%20commissioner%20with%20a%20goal%20of%20building%20relationships%2C%20increasing%20trust%2C%20and%20sharing%20information.%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Cspan%20data-ccp-props%3D%22%7B%7D%22%3E%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fp%3E","color":"#1c345e","end":"2023-11-11T15:30:00","duration":"01:30","options":""},{"title":"Planning Commission","primary_calendar_name":"Meetings","calendar_displays":["1"],"start":"2023-11-08T18:30:00","url":"https:\/\/maps.app.goo.gl\/xdiiLskgjMW1q1dy7","location":"5334 S PRINCE ST., LITTLETON CO 80120","image":"<img src=\"\/revize\/plugins\/_editforms_\/v2\/images\/placeholder.png\" alt=\"Revize update image\"\/>","rid":"85","id":"85","desc":"This%20is%20a%20public%20hearing%20for%20proposed%20oil%20and%20gas%20resolution%20updates.%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%22https%3A%2F%2Farapahoe.legistar.com%2FDepartmentDetail.aspx%3FID%3D44526%26amp%3BGUID%3DF78E7E7B-A182-4EBD-9F36-FDDB02EE71A0%26amp%3BR%3Dca93c6f2-a32a-4002-8702-d6d28a0a5100%22%20target%3D%22_blank%22%3EView%20the%20agenda%20on%20our%20Legistar%20portal.%3C%2Fa%3E","color":"#a12034","end":"2023-11-08T20:30:00","d