nity%20to%20interact%20with%20your%20elected%20commissioner%20with%20a%20goal%20of%20building%20relationships%2C%20increasing%20trust%2C%20and%20sharing%20information.%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cstrong%3ESunday%2C%20May%2019%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Cstrong%3E2-3%3A30%20p.m.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3ESonder%20Coffee%20%26amp%3B%20Tea%3Cbr%20%2F%3E9731%20E.%20Iliff%20Ave.%2C%20Denver.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3C%2Fdiv%3E","color":"#1c345e","end":"2024-05-19T15:30:00","duration":"01:30","options":""},{"title":"2024 State of the County","primary_calendar_name":"Events","calendar_displays":["2"],"start":"2024-06-06T07:30:00","url":"","location":"","image":"<img src=\"\/revize\/plugins\/_editforms_\/v2\/images\/placeholder.png\" alt=\"Revize update image\"\/>","rid":"177","id":"177","desc":"%3Cp%3EThis%20year%27s%20theme%20is%20Responsive%20to%20our%20Community.%20Join%20Arapahoe%20County%20Commissioners%2C%20elected%20officials%20and%20special%20guests%20as%20we%20reflect%20on%20the%20past%20year%20and%20discuss%20what%20lies%20ahead.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EContinental%20breakfast%207%3A30%20a.m.%3Cbr%20%2F%3EProgram%208%26ndash%3B10%20a.m.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3ETickets%20%2435%20and%20include%20light%20breakfast.%3Cbr%20%2F%3ETables%20of%208%20available%20for%20%24300%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.arapahoecountyeventcenter.com%2Fp%2Fsignature-events%2Fstateofthecounty%22%20target%3D%22_blank%22%3EBuy%20Tickets%20Now%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E","color":"#1c345e","end":"2024-06-06T10:00:00","duration":"02:30","options":""},{"title":"Conversation with Commissioners Jeff Baker and Jessica Campbell","primary_calendar_name":"Events","calendar_displays":["2"],"start":"2024-06-20T18:00:00","url":"","location":"23155 E. Heritage Pkwy., Aurora, CO 80016","image":"<img src=\"\/revize\/plugins\/_editforms_\/v2\/images\/placeholder.png\" alt=\"Revize update image\"\/>","rid":"178","id":"178","desc":"%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThursday%2C%20June%2020%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cspan%20data-contrast%3D%22auto%22%3E6-7%3A30%20p.m.%20%3C%2Fspan%3E%26nbsp%3B%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cspan%20data-contrast%3D%22auto%22%3EHeritage%20Eagle%20Bend%20Golf%20Club%3C%2Fspan%3E%26nbsp%3B%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cspan%20data-contrast%3D%22auto%22%3E23155%20E.%20Heritage%20Pkwy.%2C%20Aurora%2C%20CO%2080016%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Cspan%20data-ccp-props%3D%22%7B%26quot%3B201341983%26quot%3B%3A0%2C%26quot%3B335559739%26quot%3B%3A160%2C%26quot%3B335559740%26quot%3B%3A259%7D%22%3E%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cspan%20data-contrast%3D%22auto%22%3EJoin%20District%20Three%20Commissioner%20Jeff%20Baker%20and%20District%20Two%20Commissioner%20Jessica%20Campbell%20and%20special%20guests%20from%20Arapahoe%20County%20Community%20Resources%20for%20a%20community%20conversation.%20The%20evening%20will%20highlight%20resources%20available%20in%20Arapahoe%20County%20for%20seniors%20and%20older%20adults%20and%20discuss%20the%20County%26rsquo%3Bs%20budget%20shortfall.%20The%20Commissioners%20will%20also%20lead%20an%20informal%20conversation%20about%20County%20initiatives%20and%20answer%20questions%20from%20residents.%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Cspan%20data-ccp-props%3D%22%7B%26quot%3B201341983%26quot%3B%3A0%2C%26quot%3B335559739%26quot%3B%3A0%2C%26quot%3B335559740%26quot%3B%3A240%7D%22%3E%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fp%3E","color":"#1c345e","end":"2024-06-20T19:30:00","duration":"01:30","options":""},{"title":"VetConnections Resource & Job Fair","primary_calendar_name":"Events","calendar_displays":["2"],"start":"2024-08-10T10:00:00","url":"https:\/\/maps.app.goo.gl\/4nD8RMG4J3rehmY46","location":"CentrePoint Plaza 14980 E Alameda Dr, Aurora, CO 80012","image":"<img src=\"\/revize\/plugins\/_editforms_\/v2\/images\/placeholder.png\" alt=\"Revize update image\"\/>","rid":"179","id":"179","desc":"Veterans%20and%20active%20service%20members%2C%20join%20Arapahoe%20County%20at%20%3Cstrong%3EVetConnections%3A%20A%20Resource%20and%20Job%20Fair%20for%20Veterans%3C%2F