%7B%26quot%3BapplyListStyleFromLevel%26quot%3B%3Atrue%7D%22%3E%0A%3Cli%3EA%20live%20performance%20by%20the%20Maroon%20Bells%20Morris%20Dancers%2C%20a%20traditional%20English%20folk%20dance%20group%20known%20for%20rhythmic%20movement%2C%20music%2C%20and%20colorful%20ribbons%20and%20bells%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EAn%20optional%20dance%20lesson%20%28no%20experience%20needed%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EHands-on%20crafts%20and%20lawn%20games%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3ELight%20refreshments%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EArapahoe%20County%20Administration%20Building%20%3Cem%3EEast%3C%2Fem%3E%20Flower%20Lawn%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3E5334%20S.%20Prince%20St.%3Cbr%20%2F%3ELittleton%2C%20CO%2080120%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EWhile%20you%26rsquo%3Bre%20here%2C%20take%20a%20look%20at%20how%20this%20space%20is%20being%20transformed%20into%20a%20flower%20lawn%20that%20uses%20less%20water%2C%20supports%20pollinators%2C%20and%20is%20designed%20for%20Colorado%26rsquo%3Bs%20climate.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThis%20event%20is%20free%2C%20but%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%22noopener%22%20href%3D%22https%3A%2F%2Fflowertothepeople.com%2Ff2p-events%2Fspring-dance-party-arapahoe-county-administration-building%2F%22%20target%3D%22_blank%22%20data-auth%3D%22NotApplicable%22%20data-linkindex%3D%220%22%3Eregistration%20is%20required%3C%2Fa%3E%26nbsp%3Bby%20May%2012%20to%20help%20us%20plan%20for%20supplies.%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E","color":"#1c345e","end":"2026-05-14T13:00:00","duration":"01:00","options":""},{"title":"17 Mile House Open House: Pollinator-Friendly Gardening","primary_calendar_name":"Events","calendar_displays":["2"],"start":"2026-05-30T09:00:00","url":"www.arapahoeco.gov\/17milehouse","location":"17 Mile House Farm Park","image":"<img src=\".\/Open Space\/events\/GR_Alchemer_17MH_Pollinator_Friendly_Gardening_2026.jpg?t=202605191340340\" alt=\"Revize update image\"\/>","rid":"333","id":"333","desc":"Drop%20by%2017%20Mile%20House%20Farm%20Park%20and%20learn%20the%20basics%20of%20pollinator-friendly%20gardening.%20Visit%20with%20CSU%20Extension%20Master%20Gardeners%20and%20horticulturists%3Cbr%20%2F%3Eto%20learn%20about%20bee-friendly%20gardening%2C%20supporting%20pollinators%2C%20and%20the%20Native%20Bee%20Watch%20program.%20The%20farm%26rsquo%3Bs%20beekeeper%20will%20also%20be%20onsite%20with%3Cbr%20%2F%3Ea%20demo%20hive.%20Featured%20activities%3A%20seed-planting%20and%20free%20guided%20nature%20walk%20at%2010%20a.m.%20RSVP%20at%20www.arapahoco.gov%2F17milehouse.","color":"#1c345e","end":"2026-05-30T12:00:00","duration":"03:00","options":""},{"title":"17 Mile Open House: Quilts of Valor Presentation","primary_calendar_name":"Events","calendar_displays":["2"],"start":"2026-06-27T10:00:00","url":"www.arapahoeco.gov\/17milehouse","location":"17 Mile House Farm Park","image":"<img src=\"\/revize\/plugins\/_editforms_\/v2\/images\/placeholder.png\" alt=\"Revize update image\"\/>","rid":"334","id":"334","desc":"Join%20us%20for%20a%20special%20Open%20House%20honoring%20local%20veterans%20with%20the%20Quilts%20of%20Valor%20Foundation%20and%20the%20Smoky%20Hill%20Quilt%20Club.%20Enjoy%20a%20heartfelt%20quilt%20presentation%20ceremony%20and%20a%20fun%20kids%26rsquo%3B%20craft%20where%20children%20can%20create%20quilt%20squares%20for%20future%20veteran%20quilts.%20Held%20one%20week%20before%20the%20Fourth%20of%20July%2C%20this%20event%20also%20celebrates%20America%26rsquo%3Bs%20250th%20anniversary%20and%20Colorado%26rsquo%3Bs%20150th.%20A%20warm%2C%20meaningful%20day%20of%20history%2C%20community%2C%20and%20gratitude%20at%20the%2017%20Mile%20House%20Farm%20Park.%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3ESaturday%2C%20June%2027%2C%202026%3Cbr%20%2F%3E10%26ndash%3B11%20a.m.%20Quilts%20of%20Valor%20Presentation%3Cbr%20%2F%3E11%20a.m.%26ndash%3B1%20p.m.%20Tour%2017%20Mile%20House%3Cbr%20%2F%3E%3Cbr%20%2F%3E8181%20S.%20Parker%20Road%2C%20Centennial%2C%20CO%2080016%3Cbr%20%2F%3EFREE%20event%20%7C%20Reservations%20strongly%20encouraged%3Cbr%20%2F%3ERSVP%