338","id":"338","desc":"%3Cp%3EJoin%20the%20Rocky%20Mountain%20Weavers%20Guild%20for%20a%20hands-on%20journey%20through%20the%20history%20of%20fiber%20arts.%20Explore%20how%20textiles%20have%20evolved%26mdash%3Bfrom%20ancient%20techniques%20like%20nalbinding%20to%20modern%20electric%20spinning%20wheels.%20Enjoy%20interactive%20demonstrations%20featuring%20looms%2C%20spinning%20wheels%2C%20knitting%2C%20crocheting%2C%20nalbinding%2C%20and%20drop%20spindles.%20Learn%20more%20and%20RSVP%20at%20www.arapahoeco.gov%2F17milehouse.%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fp%3E","color":"#1c345e","end":"2026-11-07T13:00:00","duration":"03:00","options":""},{"title":"Bike to Work Day","primary_calendar_name":"Events","calendar_displays":["2"],"start":"2026-06-24T06:30:00","url":"","location":"","image":"<img src=\"\/revize\/plugins\/_editforms_\/v2\/images\/placeholder.png\" alt=\"Revize update image\"\/>","rid":"339","id":"339","desc":"Arapahoe%20County%20Open%20Spaces%20is%20participating%20in%20two%20bike%20stations.%20Stop%20by%20our%20superstation%20at%20Arapahoe%20Road%20Trailhead%20and%20along%20the%20Mary%20Carter%20Greenway%20for%20a%20hot%20breakfast%2C%20fun%20swag%20and%20a%20trail%20map.%20Learn%20more%20at%20www.arapahoeco.gov%2Fbiketowork","color":"#1c345e","end":"2026-06-24T10:30:00","duration":"04:00","options":""},{"title":"Water Matters: A Community Conversation","primary_calendar_name":"Events","calendar_displays":["2"],"start":"2026-08-01T11:00:00","url":"","location":"CentrePoint Plaza, 14980 E Alameda Dr, Aurora","image":"<img src=\"\/revize\/plugins\/_editforms_\/v2\/images\/placeholder.png\" alt=\"Revize update image\"\/>","rid":"341","id":"341","desc":"%3Cp%3E%3Cspan%20data-contrast%3D%22auto%22%3EJoin%20Arapahoe%20County%20Commissioner%20District%205%2C%20Rhonda%20Fields%2C%20for%26nbsp%3B%3C%2Fspan%3E%3Cem%3E%3Cspan%20data-contrast%3D%22auto%22%3EWater%20M